# EmuDESK 1920x1080: open C: (double-click the DISK C icon), Desk > System Info
# (first entry) -> dialog on top of the window; park the pointer bottom-right.
# Ticks hz_200 after "[desk] desktop up" (desk-arm-m3.py).
100 parkhd
400 move 38 40
600 down
603 up
608 down
611 up
2000 mark D01_C_OPEN
2100 move 40 9
2500 mark D02_DESK_MENU
2600 move 68 59
2800 down
2803 up
4000 mark D03_DIALOG
4100 parkhd
4400 mark D04_DIALOG_PARKED
4500 mark END
